    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Your hand snaps shut on stone as your feet swing into empty air. The rest of the fall waits below you.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self when a fall begins beside a reachable ledge or secure hold.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>A free hand.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Defense / Movement</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Catch the hold with a free hand and hang there before the fall travels.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9/design/cards/catch-the-ledge.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/catch-the-ledge.md</a> at <code>c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9</code>.</p></section>",
